---
title: Sequence Diagrams - (a) Hierarchical Banking, (b) Market Data, (c) Borrowing-Limit Calculation
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WBA as WB Admin
    participant WB as WorldBankReserve
    participant NB as NationalBank
    participant LB as LocalBank
    participant API as Backend
    participant U as Borrower

    rect rgb(235,245,252)
        Note over WBA,U: (a) Hierarchical capital flow
        WBA->>WB: allocateCapital(NB)
        Note right of WB: require ratio >= min
        WB-->>NB: emit CapitalAllocated
        NB-->>LB: allocateCapital(LB)
        LB-->>API: pool funded
    end

    rect rgb(228,240,250)
        Note over WBA,U: (b) Market-data retrieval
        U->>API: GET /market
        Note right of API: cache miss?
        API->>WB: Chainlink price feeds
        WB-->>API: ETH/USD, fiat pairs
        API-->>U: prices (cached 10s)
    end

    rect rgb(220,235,248)
        Note over WBA,U: (c) Borrowing-limit calculation
        U->>API: POST /loans
        API->>LB: read SBT + tier
        LB-->>API: tier cap + loan cap
        Note right of API: ceiling + cap checks
        alt Pass
            API-->>U: proceed to ML scoring
        else Fail
            API-->>U: limit exceeded
        end
    end
